---
import LayoutPages from "../layouts/layoutPages.astro";
---

<LayoutPages title="Contáctanos">
  <section class="relative py-24 bg-gray-50 overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Patrón decorativo de fondo -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#e41e2608_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-size-[30px_30px] z-0"></div>
    
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        
        <div class="contact-info">
          <div class="inline-block bg-red-100 text-red-600 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide mb-6">
            Estamos para servirte
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-chocolate leading-tight">
            Hablemos de <span class="text-red-600">Sabor</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-12">
            ¿Tienes una tienda y quieres distribuir nuestros productos? ¿O simplemente quieres salsas para tu hogar? Déjanos un mensaje.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex gap-6 transition-transform duration-300 hover:translate-x-3">
              <div class="w-15 h-15 bg-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100">
                📍
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-chocolate mb-1">Visítanos</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Intercomunal Barquisimeto "Duaca, Km.12, Tamaca".</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Estado Lara - Venezuela</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-6 transition-transform duration-300 hover:translate-x-3">
              <div class="w-15 h-15 bg-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100">
                📞
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-chocolate mb-1">Llámanos</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">+58 424-527.5766</p>
                <span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Atención inmediata</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-6 transition-transform duration-300 hover:translate-x-3">
              <div class="w-15 h-15 bg-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100">
                ✉️
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-chocolate mb-1">Escríbenos</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">contacto@alipronorte.com</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-wrapper bg-white p-10 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-chocolate mb-2">Envía un mensaje</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-500">Te responderemos en menos de 24 horas.</p>
          </div>
          
          <form class="space-y-6">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Tu Nombre</label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Ej. Jorge Briceño" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all duration-300" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Tu Correo</label>
                <input type="email" placeholder="correo@ejemplo.com" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all duration-300" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">¿En qué estás interesado?</label>
              <select class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all duration-300">
                <option>Ventas al Mayor</option>
                <option>Consumo Personal</option>
                <option>Sugerencias / Otros</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Tu Mensaje</label>
              <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Escribe aquí tu consulta..." class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all duration-300"></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-chocolate text-white py-4 px-6 rounded-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-3 hover:bg-red-600 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
              <span>Enviar Mensaje</span>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
                <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
              </svg>
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</LayoutPages>